    "description": "The Krinda T20 is a professional single-chip DLP projector designed specifically for training simulation and virtual reality — flight, sailing and driving simulators, intelligent manufacturing, equipment development and scientific visualisation. It delivers native WUXGA at 8,000 ANSI / 9,200 ISO lumens with a 1,000,000:1 Extreme Black contrast and an ultra-low black level, so night scenes can be rendered without the optical blending film older systems depended on.\n\nHardware warping and blending with up to 33×33 control points handles curved and dome screens, brightness balancing is performed at pixel level, frame-sequential active 3D runs up to 120 Hz, and an all-metal body is built for 24/7 operation and motion platforms (3g, optional).",
