    "description": "The Triolion TRD1055B family is a 55\" professional LCD splicing display for multi-screen video walls in control rooms, CCTV monitoring centres, broadcast studios, lobbies and retail. Each panel is a direct-LED-backlit TFT at 1920×1080 with 500 / 700 cd/m² brightness, 1,200:1 contrast, 8 ms response and 178°/178° viewing angles, built for 50,000 hours MTBF and continuous operation.\n\nThe series is offered in several bezel options (3.5 / 1.7 / 0.88 mm) so you can balance budget against seam width, and four I/O solutions — from VGA/DVI/HDMI/CVBS with loop-out to 4K HDMI/DP with HDMI loop-out and audio — let panels daisy-chain or be driven individually by a controller such as the Triolion TMC6000-G2. RS232/RJ45 control and optional IR make wall-wide power and source management simple. The exact model suffix (B7/B8/B9/BA/BB) depends on the bezel and brightness selected; we confirm it at quotation.",
